ember","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T17:47:11-07:00","id":257715,"title":"","content":"I try and compose all of my posts using the following chart. I find it helps me greatly especially on hot button topics. This is basically a graphical interpretation of what I was trying to say earlier<br /> <img src=\"http://www.fromgoodtooutstanding.com/wp-content/uploads/2011/09/Screen-shot-2011-09-11-at-13.40.08.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/444-dessembrae","name":"Dessembrae","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar444_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"362"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T20:06:11-07:00","id":257809,"title":"","content":"I have been reading this thread and I had to add in my own two cents. <br /> One day, someone in the Trinity Continuum forum posted up how he wanted to add magic to Adventure! My post started out with &quot;I think that adding in magic is anti-thematic. I also would never do it in my chronicle. With that being said? This is how I would do it.&quot;<br /> It is that simple. I stated objections to the premise of the thread and then I did everything I could to be constructive. The end result? The guy thanked me. It is possible to go &quot;Yeah, that idea does not seem the best IN MY OPINION...however, I can see the merits of it.&quot; It is called just being constructive. Most everyone will respond to suggestions before objections. So offer suggestions.<br /> Not to mention, if someone says something that absolutely appalls you, then do the easiest thing in the world and ignore it. If someone has an idea that you are absolutely antithetical about, then just move past the thread. Everyone's opinions are right to them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-15T22:27:07-07:00","id":257894,"title":"","content":"I did something similar to that when someone mentioned using the God of Abraham in Scion. The idea itself, to me is just a no because I know far to many people who can't check their religion at the door, so to avoid having to reach across and bitch-slap anyone at my table for getting all Serious at our happy pretendy (Note: I just added pretendy to my computers dictionary so that it will never come up as misspelled again, just thought I'd share that) fun time, I just avoid it. But in the many posts there were a few responses that had good points in them so I kinda collected them in posts and was like &quot;If you feel you must add that to this game HERE is some posts that make good points, and this is how I'd put them together&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'll be your Huckleberry","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2397-the-dude","name":"The Dude","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"108"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-26T10:35:51-07:00","id":266292,"title":"","content":"This is a great &quot;Don't be a dick&quo